          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><div><b>How Does BrainMary Work?</b></div></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Enter your subtitle here\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">BrainMary is designed to support key areas of cognitive wellness, including memory, focus, mental clarity, and healthy brain function. Its formula provides nutritional support for normal neural communication and cognitive processes, helping complement everyday mental performance and overall brain wellness.\n<br>\n<br>BrainMary is formulated to support healthy information processing and balanced cognitive function, helping you stay mentally engaged throughout your daily routine. By supporting normal brain function, it complements attention, concentration, organization, and mental clarity during work, study, and everyday responsibilities.\n<br>\n<br>Many people include BrainMary as part of their daily wellness routine to support focus, alertness, and mental sharpness. Its carefully selected ingredients provide nutritional support for healthy brain function and neural activity, making it a convenient addition to a lifestyle focused on cognitive wellness and everyday mental performance.\n<br>\n<br>BrainMary is also designed to support steady cognitive wellness during mentally demanding activities. By supporting healthy cognitive function, its formula complements concentration, focus, and mental alertness throughout busy days while helping you maintain an active and engaged mindset.\n<br>\n<br>Individual results with BrainMary may vary depending on factors such as age, lifestyle, diet, and overall health. For best results, BrainMary should be used as part of a healthy lifestyle that includes a balanced diet, regular physical activity, adequate sleep, and positive daily habits. Combined with consistent use, these habits can provide a well-rounded approach to long-term cognitive wellness and overall brain health.&nbsp;<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
