          "_name": "team2",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"team2\" group=\"Team\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/html\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"2\" max=\"6\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Card</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparentCard\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"cardBg\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"!transparentCard\">\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n        </select>\n        <header condition=\"showSocial\">Social</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Social\" name=\"showSocial\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"socialCount\" title=\"Count\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"showSocial\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"socialIconColor\" value=\"#6592e6\" condition=\"showSocial\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#fafafa\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#cebfaf\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        \n        \n        <div class=\"item features-image active\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <a href=\"https://hop.clickbank.net/?affiliate=sasmita12&vendor=cognicare&pid=pre1&tid=brnmry\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/6a76d95703343f290fd7ae13-1.webp\" alt=\"customer-1\" data-slide-to=\"0\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\"></a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style m-0 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Boost Your Memory Naturally with BrainMary</b></h5>\n                            <h4 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\"></h4>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .social-row\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">“At first I was skeptical, but after consistently incorporating BrainMary into my routine, I felt more focused during long work sessions. I used to find it harder to stay engaged around 3 p.m., but I now feel more mentally steady. I still prioritize good sleep, a balanced diet, and regular exercise, but BrainMary has become a helpful part of my daily wellness routine.”<br>“For me, the real value has been the overall experience. It’s not like flipping a switch, but I’ve enjoyed making BrainMary part of my daily routine and staying more intentional about my cognitive wellness. I also appreciate having a convenient supplement that fits easily alongside my other healthy habits.”&nbsp;<br><b>Celina.v - Miami, FL</b></p>\n                            <div class=\"social-row display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-facebook\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>1\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-twitter\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>2\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://instagram.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-instagram\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>3\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-youtube\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>4\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-telegram\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div><div class=\"item features-image\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <a href=\"https://hop.clickbank.net/?affiliate=sasmita12&vendor=cognicare&pid=pre1&tid=brnmry\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/65e5b8c7624ac-testimonial-face-sam-288x288.png\" alt=\"customer-2\" data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\"></a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style m-0 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Thankyou For Unique Formula...</b></h5>\n                            <h4 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\"><b>Works wonders! Helped me get my BP under control.</b></h4>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .social-row\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">“I started taking it about six weeks ago and have noticed a positive difference in my everyday routine. I feel more organized with details like appointments and conversations, and I’ve also felt less mentally tired in the late afternoon. I haven’t noticed any issues so far, and I’m happy with how it fits into my wellness routine.”<br>“What I appreciate most is that it doesn’t feel like a stimulant. I enjoy the gradual sense of focus and mental clarity without the jitters or afternoon crash I’ve experienced with other products. It has become a simple part of my morning routine alongside my coffee and daily vitamins.”&nbsp;<br><b>David R. - TEXAS</b><br></p>\n                            <div class=\"social-row display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-facebook\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>1\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-twitter\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>2\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://instagram.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-instagram\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>3\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-youtube\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>4\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-telegram\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div><div class=\"item features-image\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <a href=\"https://hop.clickbank.net/?affiliate=sasmita12&vendor=cognicare&pid=pre1&tid=brnmry\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/647845cb99edf58d8fd813ae-288x288.png\" alt=\"customer-3\"></a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style m-0 mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>This surprised me !</b></h5>\n                            <h4 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\"><b>All natural solution for hypertension</b></h4>\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .social-row\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">“I started taking it about six weeks ago and have noticed a real difference in my daily routine. I feel more confident remembering everyday details, such as appointments and things I want to say, and I’ve also noticed less mental fatigue in the late afternoon. I haven’t experienced any issues so far, and I would recommend it to anyone looking for gentle daily cognitive support.”<br>“What I appreciate most is that it doesn’t feel like a stimulant. The sense of clarity and focus feels gradual and natural, without the jitters or crash I associate with some other products. It has become a regular part of my morning routine, right alongside my coffee and daily vitamins.”\n<br><b>&nbsp;Rebecaa S, TX</b><br></p>\n                            <div class=\"social-row display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/Mobirise/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-facebook\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>1\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-twitter\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>2\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://instagram.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-instagram\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>3\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-youtube\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"socialCount>4\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/mobirise\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-telegram\"></span>\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
