        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor"
          },
          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Enter your subtitle here\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">BrainMary goes beyond a typical supplement with a comprehensive, plant-based formula designed to support brain health, memory, focus, mental clarity, and overall cognitive wellness. Its carefully selected blend of botanical and nutritional ingredients provides convenient daily support for maintaining an active, focused, and healthy mind as part of a balanced lifestyle.&nbsp;<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vixzSzA3Qo",
          "_anchor": "content5-7d",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#1046a9\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <div><span style=\"font-size: 22.7657px;\"><b><br></b></span></div><ul>\n                        <li><span style=\"font-size: 22.7657px;\"><b>Supports Memory:&nbsp; </b>BrainMary is designed to support healthy memory function and cognitive wellness by providing nutritional support for normal brain activity and neural communication. Its carefully selected formula complements the natural processes involved in learning, information processing, and recall, helping support everyday mental clarity and cognitive performance.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 22.7657px;\">&nbsp;<b>Supports Focus &amp; Concentration:&nbsp;</b>BrainMary provides daily nutritional support for attention, concentration, and sustained mental engagement. Its formula is designed to complement healthy cognitive function, helping you stay attentive and mentally engaged during work, study, reading, and other activities that require consistent focus.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 22.7657px;\"><b>Plant-Based Ingredients:&nbsp; </b>BrainMary features carefully selected botanical and naturally derived ingredients chosen to support brain health and overall cognitive wellness. The formula includes ingredients such as Bacopa Monnieri, Ginkgo Biloba, Rhodiola Root, and other nutritional compounds designed to provide convenient daily support for memory, focus, mental clarity, and healthy cognitive function.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 22.7657px;\"><b>Supports Cognitive Wellness:&nbsp; </b>BrainMary is formulated to support overall brain health, mental clarity, and balanced cognitive function. Its ingredients provide nutritional support for normal neural activity, attention, information processing, and everyday mental performance, making it a convenient addition to a healthy lifestyle focused on long-term cognitive wellness.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 22.7657px;\"><b>Supports Mental Energy &amp; Alertness:&nbsp; </b>BrainMary provides nutritional support for mental alertness and cognitive wellness during everyday periods of mental demand. Its formula complements healthy brain function and can support an engaged, attentive mindset throughout the day, while healthy sleep, balanced nutrition, hydration, and regular physical activity remain important foundations of overall cognitive health.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 22.7657px;\"><b>Supports Stress &amp; Mental Resilience: </b>BrainMary includes ingredients such as Rhodiola Root and Bacopa Monnieri that have been studied for their potential role in supporting the body’s response to everyday stress. By complementing balanced mood, mental resilience, and cognitive wellness, the formula can be part of a daily routine designed to help you stay mentally engaged during demanding periods.</span></li></ul><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 22.7657px;\"><b>Supports Healthy Brain Aging: </b>Maintaining cognitive wellness is an important part of healthy aging. BrainMary provides nutritional and antioxidant support for normal brain function while complementing healthy habits such as regular exercise, quality sleep, balanced nutrition, and ongoing mental activity that support long-term brain health.</span></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
